  "description": {
   "en": "Nanako Fujiwara, a socially isolated high school girl, remains an outcast even after transferring schools—until one day, her life takes a dramatic turn!\n\nShe’s unexpectedly tasked with a crucial mission: selecting the next heir of a powerful conglomerate (zaibatsu). To \"accurately evaluate the candidates’ leadership qualities,\" she must live with four dazzlingly handsome brothers competing for the title:\n\nYamato Mitsurugi (Eldest):\n\nFlawless Student Council President\n\nVibe: \"Excellence isn’t my goal—it’s my default.\"\n\nShizumaru Tenhou (Second):\n\nUndefeated Street Fighter\n\nVibe: \"Try saying no. I’ll make you regret it.\"\n\nHikaru Sennen-zaka (Third):\n\nIllegally Adorable Mascot\n\nVibe: \"Nee-chan, let’s bake cookies!\" (…Why is his stock portfolio outperforming Wall Street?)\n\nUkyou Sumeragi (Youngest):\n\nMysterious Beauty Incarnate\n\nVibe: \"You keep staring… Do I haunt your dreams?\"\n\nThe Catch: Each brother deploys every tactic imaginable—from sweet persuasion to corporate sabotage—to win Nanako’s favor."
  },
